    LLM: "Keep your high trumps (Ace, Three) for the very end of the game or to capture high-point tricks.\n\nUse the first card of your double trick to 'fish' for an opponent's high trump or to set up your second card to win.\n\nSince suit following is not required, use your 'scraps' (non-point cards) to signal to your partner which suits you are strong in without losing points.",
